abstract: >-
  Python tools to compute individual and group structural covariance matrices
  and diffusion-map cortical gradients from cortical thickness, including a
  DrawEM32 to MCRIBS (M-CRIB-S) Desikan-Killiany converter for dHCP neonatal data.
keywords:
  - MCRIBS
  - M-CRIB-S
  - DrawEM
  - dHCP
  - cortical thickness
  - structural covariance
  - cortical gradients
  - BrainSpace
  - neonatal neuroimaging
